{"slug":"Phantom-Forces-or-ESP-or-Pretty-bad-but-works-or-Might-or-might-not-update_18","_id":"61aa3335240ecbad60d821c0","title":"ESP | Pretty bad but works | Open Source | Might or might not update","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77e0e","gameId":292439477,"name":"Phantom Forces","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-081cd8b36c1e3845b84b7ab5273c8004-843c8a7aef01.png","placeId":292439477},"features":"- Box ESP\n\n[Made by me (https://www.scriptblox.com/u/Shine)]","tags":["ESP","pf","wallhack","open source","shine"],"script":"getgenv().thing = true;\n\t\nwhile getgenv().thing do wait(1)\n\n\tfor _, v in pairs(game:GetService(\"CoreGui\"):GetChildren()) do\n\t\tif(v.Name == \"Box\") then\n\t\t\tv:Destroy();\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\tfor _, team in pairs(game:GetService(\"Workspace\").Players:GetChildren()) do\n\t\tfor _, v in pairs(team:GetChildren()) do\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tif(v:FindFirstChild(\"Torso\")) then\n\t\t\t\tlocal box = Instance.new(\"BoxHandleAdornment\");\n\t\t\t\tbox.Name = \"Box\";\n\t\t\t\tbox.Adornee = v.Torso;\n\t\t\t\tbox.AlwaysOnTop = true;\n\t\t\t\tbox.ZIndex = 10;\n\t\t\t\tbox.Size = v.Torso.Size * Vector3.new(1.6, 3, 1.6);\n\t\t\t\tbox.Transparency = 0.5;\n\t\t\t\tbox.Color = BrickColor.new(team.Name)\n\t\t\t\tbox.Parent = game:GetService(\"CoreGui\");\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\nend","owner":{"_id":"61a7ece74585414929d72eea","username":"Shine","verified":true,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/61a7ece74585414929d72eea-1692540020475.png","status":"offline","id":"61a7ece74585414929d72eea","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.views","tier":1000000}},"verified":true,"views":55185,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"createdAt":"2021-12-03T15:09:41.592Z","visibility":"public","dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":4,"image":"https://t3.rbxcdn.com/f343b993f64037e7518598fde91131ed","executes":45,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e3b360710ec3c4de68","editBy":{"_id":"61a7ece74585414929d72eea","username":